A forwarding rule must contain exactly one final action (`ForwardGroup`, `Redirect` or `FixedResponse`), and that action is executed last, so the `RemoveHeader` extension action has to be declared with a smaller <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`order`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Order`" pulumi-lang-go="`order`" pulumi-lang-python="`order`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`order`" pulumi-lang-java="`order`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`order`">`order`</span>. The example below reuses the listener and the server group created above.


