			MemorySize:       pulumi.Float64Ref(4),
		}, nil)
		if err != nil {
			return err
		}
		defaultGetImages, err := ecs.GetImages(ctx, &ecs.GetImagesArgs{
			NameRegex:  pulumi.StringRef("^ubuntu_18.*64"),
