> **NOTE:** It is recommended to use the <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`alicloud.sslcertificatesservicepcacert.Sync`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`alicloud.sslcertificatesservicepcacert.Sync`" pulumi-lang-go="`sslcertificatesservicepcacert.Sync`" pulumi-lang-python="`sslcertificatesservicepcacert.Sync`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`alicloud.sslcertificatesservicepcacert.Sync`" pulumi-lang-java="`alicloud.sslcertificatesservicepcacert.Sync`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`alicloud_ssl_certificates_service_pca_cert_sync`">`alicloud.sslcertificatesservicepcacert.Sync`</span> action (available since v2.0.0-beta5, requires Terraform 1.14 or later) when the synchronization should run as part of the certificate lifecycle: the action can be wired with <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`actionTrigger`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`ActionTrigger`" pulumi-lang-go="`actionTrigger`" pulumi-lang-python="`action_trigger`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`actionTrigger`" pulumi-lang-java="`actionTrigger`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`action_trigger`">`actionTrigger`</span> (for example, after client certificates are created) and runs without storing any state. Use this resource when the synchronization is a standalone batch operation.

